The table structure information is (table names): 
['weekly_sales', 'shopping_cart_users', 'bitcoin_members', 'interest_metrics', 'customer_regions', 'customer_transactions', 'bitcoin_transactions', 'customer_nodes', 'cleaned_weekly_sales', 'veg_txn_df', 'shopping_cart_events', 'shopping_cart_page_hierarchy', 'bitcoin_prices', 'interest_map', 'veg_loss_rate_df', 'shopping_cart_campaign_identifier', 'veg_cat', 'veg_whsle_df', 'shopping_cart_event_identifier']
Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns, their potential usage, and typical conditions  
• veg_whsle_df."whsle_date": filter rows that fall between ‘2020‑01‑01’ and ‘2023‑12‑31’; extract year for yearly KPIs  
• veg_whsle_df."item_code": key for joining wholesale, transaction, category and loss‑rate data  
• veg_whsle_df."whsle_px_rmb-kg": wholesale price used to derive AVG/MIN/MAX/DIFF/TOTAL wholesale values  
• veg_txn_df."txn_date": filter rows that fall between ‘2020‑01‑01’ and ‘2023‑12‑31’; extract year for yearly KPIs  
• veg_txn_df."qty_sold(kg)": multiply by selling price to find total selling value  
• veg_txn_df."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg": selling price per kg – used for total & AVG selling values  
• veg_cat."category_name": roll‑up field to calculate metrics per vegetable category  
• veg_loss_rate_df."loss_rate_%": loss percentage that will be averaged or multiplied by quantity to measure total loss  
Typical WHERE conditions you will see in the queries below  
WHERE strftime('%Y', "whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'  
WHERE strftime('%Y', "txn_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'  

Below are 10 exploratory SQL queries (all limited to 20 rows) that move from simple inspection to the more complex aggregations required for the final profit analysis.

```sql
-- 1) Distinct years present in wholesale data (2020‑2023?)
SELECT DISTINCT strftime('%Y', "whsle_date") AS "year"
FROM "veg_whsle_df"
WHERE strftime('%Y', "whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) View a sample of wholesale prices with corresponding item codes and dates
SELECT "whsle_date",
       "item_code",
       "whsle_px_rmb-kg"
FROM "veg_whsle_df"
WHERE strftime('%Y', "whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Distinct vegetable categories available
SELECT DISTINCT "category_name"
FROM "veg_cat"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Average wholesale price per category (all years) – quick sense‑check
SELECT c."category_name",
       ROUND(AVG(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"), 2) AS "avg_wholesale_price"
FROM "veg_whsle_df" AS w
JOIN "veg_cat"       AS c ON w."item_code" = c."item_code"
WHERE strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP BY c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Min and max wholesale price per year (all categories combined)
SELECT strftime('%Y', "whsle_date") AS "year",
       ROUND(MIN("whsle_px_rmb-kg"), 2) AS "min_wholesale_price",
       ROUND(MAX("whsle_px_rmb-kg"), 2) AS "max_wholesale_price"
FROM "veg_whsle_df"
WHERE strftime('%Y', "whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP BY strftime('%Y', "whsle_date")
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Quantity‑weighted average selling price per year & category
SELECT strftime('%Y', t."txn_date")           AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(SUM(t."qty_sold(kg)" * t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg") /
             SUM(t."qty_sold(kg)"), 2)        AS "weighted_avg_sell_px"
FROM "veg_txn_df" AS t
JOIN "veg_cat"   AS c ON t."item_code" = c."item_code"
WHERE strftime('%Y', t."txn_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP BY strftime('%Y', t."txn_date"), c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Average loss rate by category
SELECT c."category_name",
       ROUND(AVG(l."loss_rate_%"), 2) AS "avg_loss_rate_%"
FROM "veg_loss_rate_df" AS l
JOIN "veg_cat"          AS c ON l."item_code" = c."item_code"
GROUP BY c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Total wholesale cost per year & category (price * qty proxy using 1 kg as unit if qty absent)
-- Here we keep it simple: total wholesale price = ∑ wholesale price (kg) across records
SELECT strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date") AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(SUM(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"), 2) AS "total_wholesale_price"
FROM "veg_whsle_df" AS w
JOIN "veg_cat"      AS c ON w."item_code" = c."item_code"
WHERE strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP BY strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date"), c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) Total selling revenue per year & category
SELECT strftime('%Y', t."txn_date")          AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(SUM(t."qty_sold(kg)" * t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg"), 2) AS "total_sell_price"
FROM "veg_txn_df" AS t
JOIN "veg_cat"   AS c ON t."item_code" = c."item_code"
WHERE strftime('%Y', t."txn_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP BY strftime('%Y', t."txn_date"), c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10) Profit (sell – wholesale – loss) per year & category
SELECT fin."year",
       fin."category_name",
       ROUND(fin."total_sell_price"              , 2) AS "total_sell_price",
       ROUND(fin."total_wholesale_price"         , 2) AS "total_wholesale_price",
       ROUND(fin."total_wholesale_price" * fin."avg_loss_rate_%"/100, 2) AS "total_loss",
       ROUND(fin."total_sell_price" - fin."total_wholesale_price" -
             fin."total_wholesale_price" * fin."avg_loss_rate_%"/100, 2) AS "profit"
FROM (
    SELECT y."year",
           y."category_name",
           y."total_wholesale_price",
           s."total_sell_price",
           l."avg_loss_rate_%"
    FROM (
        -- wholesale sub‑query
        SELECT strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date") AS "year",
               c."category_name",
               SUM(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg")       AS "total_wholesale_price"
        FROM "veg_whsle_df" w
        JOIN "veg_cat"  c ON w."item_code" = c."item_code"
        WHERE strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
        GROUP BY strftime('%Y', w."whsle_date"), c."category_name"
    ) y
    JOIN (
        -- selling sub‑query
        SELECT strftime('%Y', t."txn_date")    AS "year",
               c."category_name",
               SUM(t."qty_sold(kg)" * t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg") AS "total_sell_price"
        FROM "veg_txn_df" t
        JOIN "veg_cat" c ON t."item_code" = c."item_code"
        WHERE strftime('%Y', t."txn_date") BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
        GROUP BY strftime('%Y', t."txn_date"), c."category_name"
    ) s
      ON y."year" = s."year" AND y."category_name" = s."category_name"
    JOIN (
        -- average loss rate sub‑query
        SELECT c."category_name",
               AVG(l."loss_rate_%") AS "avg_loss_rate_%"
        FROM "veg_loss_rate_df" l
        JOIN "veg_cat" c ON l."item_code" = c."item_code"
        GROUP BY c."category_name"
    ) l
      ON y."category_name" = l."category_name"
) fin
LIMIT 20;
```

The progression of these queries lets you validate data availability (years, items, categories), inspect raw values, and ultimately combine wholesale, selling, and loss‑rate information into a profit estimate—rounded to two decimal places—for every vegetable category between 2020 and 2023.
